{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_080d0373aeeb484ca70e1e17007108e7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_679b873b4faed71c7713b5ca64686ecf1c1612b3ff32e459e6d0e8dbce97fccf","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"fstandhartinger/ralph-wiggum@3f15f0fb83b8 snapshot e715ed74bb1d3916","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d4fc61ae920b8b11a19f719457e8051f806df750a3f8974917d7d8e2e9029ccc"],"source_ids":["src_8b52ccd5108f53b9bc599696af983bab"],"text":"Build mode can take an iteration-count argument, e.g. ralph-loop.sh 20 for a maximum of 20 iterations, or run unlimited by default.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_080d0373aeeb484ca70e1e17007108e7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_080d0373aeeb484ca70e1e17007108e7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_806b0ce8ea54bd68c16e2646dd8bd37bfe7fdde8ae2614d55fc88ae69a2f6f65","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"fstandhartinger/ralph-wiggum@3f15f0fb83b8 snapshot e715ed74bb1d3916","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3b4ace6e19af3dc66beca1f74103f83237471411f140092a24034bbb77b5bf34","slc_50d78458ee228e8350733add0269d8af06f3897acfd07b7338621ac4e6b77842","slc_6cc4750434834f5ab1ccee2c6dd9d5d10ddca73c48b70463c0e72ec4ed7ba764"],"source_ids":["src_8b52ccd5108f53b9bc599696af983bab"],"text":"State persists on disk between loops: IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md is read to pick tasks and updated with progress, while each iteration starts with a fresh context window.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_080d0373aeeb484ca70e1e17007108e7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_080d0373aeeb484ca70e1e17007108e7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_92e51fa9f1505abca14ac91957c2d6af977a6a7b04997b81dc7cacca8a86cd97","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"fstandhartinger/ralph-wiggum@3f15f0fb83b8 snapshot e715ed74bb1d3916","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_28fe27930089f34f8b5a47bd887ecfb28a78255c3f21c910d95edbb280c13d53","slc_bb369232eded0755b3d96378d81a805dd6aa1877f0625eefba64a735613b5b0e"],"source_ids":["src_8b52ccd5108f53b9bc599696af983bab"],"text":"Each spec tracks an attempt count as an NR_OF_TRIES comment; after 10 attempts without completion a spec is flagged as stuck and should be split into smaller specs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_080d0373aeeb484ca70e1e17007108e7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_080d0373aeeb484ca70e1e17007108e7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ba1df09cb4c97ce73f242c6f0d3831f8fd2238a929e80e0972de2c9b79a238f1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"fstandhartinger/ralph-wiggum@3f15f0fb83b8 snapshot e715ed74bb1d3916","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4f9147adbe33304e64bec140ed9c7ae6d697483a8c37a705d592794727dccd66","slc_7769ea1c79964eba42912439a4c821216a80d1f2c8b7d5d98320a63a2ee1ab65","slc_d334e774dc34e237ccd803a8dc09a2c3b56969691db97e5c5fc1f62329e83a15"],"source_ids":["src_8b52ccd5108f53b9bc599696af983bab"],"text":"Completion is gated on a magic phrase: the agent outputs <promise>DONE</promise> only when acceptance criteria are verified, tests pass, and changes are committed and pushed; the loop retries otherwise.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_080d0373aeeb484ca70e1e17007108e7"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_080d0373aeeb484ca70e1e17007108e7","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c8dae0f491917aabb4b0b0f8b0ad0550810fe64a1742919014dae28be3df35d1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"fstandhartinger/ralph-wiggum@3f15f0fb83b8 snapshot e715ed74bb1d3916","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1d3e5b31c52bd5a1ac96302625b08c1cb0615331f87549ca4410d2ed6f456aaa","slc_342710673ad914c5e7b7a187ba503f937e19718d36a71b0dc711f0698fd5c4fb"],"source_ids":["src_8b52ccd5108f53b9bc599696af983bab"],"text":"The product is driven by shell scripts: ralph-loop.sh (default build mode) and an optional 'plan' mode invoked as ralph-loop.sh plan, with matching PowerShell .ps1 variants.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:01:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_080d0373aeeb484ca70e1e17007108e7"}
